 102:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****          In Slave mode, if HAL_I2S_DMAStop is used to stop the communication, an error
 103:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****          HAL_I2S_ERROR_BUSY_LINE_RX is raised as the master continue to transmit data.
