 130:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c **** 
 131:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****           Function HAL_I2S_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 132:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) TxCpltCallback        : I2S Tx Completed callback
 133:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) RxCpltCallback        : I2S Rx Completed callback
 134:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) TxHalfCpltCallback    : I2S Tx Half Completed callback
 135:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) RxHalfCpltCallback    : I2S Rx Half Completed callback
 136:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) ErrorCallback         : I2S Error callback
 137:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) MspInitCallback       : I2S Msp Init callback
 138:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) MspDeInitCallback     : I2S Msp DeInit callback
 139:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****           This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 140:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****           and a pointer to the user callback function.
