 176:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****        When the compilation define USE_HAL_I2S_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 177:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_i2s.c ****        not defined, the callback registering feature is not available
